  "translation": "Na tu, ol samting bilong wokim — gol na silva — bilong haus bilong Elohim, we Nevukadnetsar i tekim aut long hauskrai we i stap long Yerusalayim na i karamapim ol i go long hauskrai bilong Bavel: Kores king i tekim ol aut long hauskrai bilong Bavel, na ol i givim ol long wanpela man, nem bilong em Sheshbatsar, we em i makim bilong i kamap gavana.",
